   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "在金属罐上涂上水泥风格的涂料，放在厨房用作工作台盛具",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/bb/2c/bb2c9787e3dfd7f371e92f9715b15eb6.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/bb/2c/bb2c9787e3dfd7f371e92f9715b15eb6.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>1.从空罐子到厨房盛具&nbsp;</strong>用可爱的储物罐盛放刀叉和厨房必需品，放在工作台上随手取拿。移除标签。仔细清洁罐子。然后涂上颜料。我们用类似水泥的带纹理颜料涂抹罐子。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "在玻璃食品罐的盖子上粘上厨房拉钮，将其用作浴室储物件",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/af/2b/af2b1939447f0695ecfc788ca5a3fee3.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/af/2b/af2b1939447f0695ecfc788ca5a3fee3.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>2.从调料罐变成化妆品收纳件&nbsp;</strong>使用玻璃罐便于看清里面盛装的东西及其剩余量。利用这一创意，我们将厨房用品改造成了浴室用品。将用过的玻璃罐洗净并晾干。在盖子上粘上拉纽或把手。快速打造复古时尚的药剂师专用瓶外观。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "用布料和旧书页包裹旧鞋盒，让它们变成全新的储物盒",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/39/5d/395d1b34515d50c2a3a9c90d26296a9b.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/39/5d/395d1b34515d50c2a3a9c90d26296a9b.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "用布料和旧书页包裹旧鞋盒，让它们变成全新的储物盒",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4a/f6/4af61eb97888b1fc12b4a51fba2d1fd4.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4a/f6/4af61eb97888b1fc12b4a51fba2d1fd4.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>3.从旧鞋盒变成时髦的装饰品&nbsp;</strong>鞋盒是非常实用的储物盒。为什么要把它们藏起来呢？翻新一下，把它们展示出来，无论里面装了什么都没关系。在外面粘上一些布料、报纸或旧书页，无论是什么，只要能够搭配你房间的风格即可。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "把旧木塞钉到软木锅垫上，变成可挂在墙壁上的首饰收纳件",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1a/3b/1a3b4da49d49378fa3277e9ca68850b3.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
